{"seq":3,"slug":"steady-state-hypothesis","title":"稳态与假设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/chaos-engineering/foundations/steady-state-hypothesis","wordCount":1662,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"稳态与假设\">稳态与假设</h1><p>混沌工程和&quot;随便把东西搞坏看看&quot;之间,只隔着一样东西:一个可证伪的假设。没有假设的破坏只是破坏;有了假设,破坏才成为实验。这个假设的核心对象,就是系统的&quot;稳态&quot;(steady state)——一组能代表系统正常运转的可测量指标。先把稳态定义清楚,才谈得上&quot;故障是否破坏了它&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>稳态不是指&quot;系统没有任何变化&quot;,恰恰相反,健康的生产系统时刻都在波动:流量有日夜峰谷,延迟有抖动,错误率从不严格为零。稳态指的是这些指标维持在一个可预期的、代表业务正常的范围或模式内。Netflix 选用的经典稳态指标是 SPS(streams per second,每秒视频启播数)——它直接反映用户在正常看视频,且对系统各层故障都敏感。一个好的稳态指标应满足:贴近用户体验、可实时测量、对故障敏感、且在正常时足够稳定以便检测偏离。</p>\n<p>混沌实验的标准结构,正是围绕稳态展开的可证伪假设:</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[定义稳态&lt;br/&gt;选择业务相关SLI] --&gt; B[提出假设&lt;br/&gt;注入故障后稳态仍维持]&#10;    B --&gt; C[设置对照组与实验组]&#10;    C --&gt; D[在实验组注入真实世界事件]&#10;    D --&gt; E{稳态是否维持?}&#10;    E --&gt;|维持| F[假设未被证伪&lt;br/&gt;韧性得到证据支持]&#10;    E --&gt;|偏离| G[发现脆弱点&lt;br/&gt;记录并修复]&#10;    G --&gt; H[修复后重做实验]\">flowchart TD\n    A[定义稳态&lt;br/&gt;选择业务相关SLI] --&gt; B[提出假设&lt;br/&gt;注入故障后稳态仍维持]\n    B --&gt; C[设置对照组与实验组]\n    C --&gt; D[在实验组注入真实世界事件]\n    D --&gt; E{稳态是否维持?}\n    E --&gt;|维持| F[假设未被证伪&lt;br/&gt;韧性得到证据支持]\n    E --&gt;|偏离| G[发现脆弱点&lt;br/&gt;记录并修复]\n    G --&gt; H[修复后重做实验]</pre><p>注意这里的逻辑是波普尔式的证伪:我们不是去&quot;证明系统很健壮&quot;,而是努力去&quot;推翻系统很健壮这个假设&quot;。这带来一个反直觉的取舍:一个从未被推翻的假设,信息量反而很低——它只说明这次注入没打中要害;而一次被推翻的假设,直接定位出一个真实存在的脆弱点。因此实验设计应当刻意去攻击系统最不设防的区域,而不是反复验证已知强壮的部分。每一次未能推翻,都增加一分对韧性的信心;一旦推翻成功,就抓到了一个真实的脆弱点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选择正确的-sli-从系统指标到用户指标\">选择正确的 SLI:从系统指标到用户指标</h2><p>新手最常犯的错误,是把稳态定义在系统指标上——CPU 使用率、内存占用、QPS。这些是因,不是果。CPU 飙到 90% 用户未必有感,而 CPU 只有 30% 时一个死锁也能让用户全部超时。稳态应当定义在贴近用户的服务等级指标(SLI)上。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标层次</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>是否适合做稳态</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>资源指标</td>\n<td>CPU、内存、磁盘</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>离用户太远,与体验弱相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统指标</td>\n<td>QPS、连接数</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>反映负载,不反映成败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务指标</td>\n<td>成功率、P99 延迟</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>直接刻画请求质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务指标</td>\n<td>每分钟成功下单、SPS</td>\n<td>最佳</td>\n<td>等同于用户在正常使用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>业务指标之所以最优,是因为它天然综合了底层所有故障:无论是数据库慢了、推荐服务挂了还是网络丢包了,只要&quot;每分钟成功下单&quot;没掉,用户就没受影响;只要它掉了,无论底层多绿,系统就是出了问题。这与<a href=\"resilience-reliability\">韧性与可靠性概念</a>中&quot;单服务指标无法刻画用户体验&quot;的结论是同一枚硬币的两面。如何把这些 SLI 进一步绑定到 SLO 与错误预算,构成混沌实验的自动中止条件,见<a href=\"../culture/sre-observability-integration\">与 SRE 和可观测性结合</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"量化稳态-从阈值到统计判定\">量化稳态:从阈值到统计判定</h2><p>&quot;稳态是否维持&quot;听起来主观,实则可以量化。最朴素的做法是设硬阈值:成功率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>99.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 99.5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99.5%</span></span></span></span></span> 且 P99 延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>300</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 300\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span> 即视为稳态。但生产指标天然有噪声,硬阈值容易误判。更稳健的做法是统计判定:用对照组的指标分布作为基线,检验实验组是否显著偏离。</p>\n<p>一种常用的偏离度量是把实验组指标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 标准化为基线分布的标准分:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mi>σ</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z = \\frac{x - \\mu}{\\sigma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是对照组(或历史同期)的均值与标准差。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|z|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 超过设定门限(如 3)且持续一段时间,才判定稳态被打破。落地时,这两类判定的原始数据通常就直接取自监控系统,例如用 PromQL 把稳态候选 SLI 拉出来实时比对:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"promql\" data-code=\"# 候选稳态 SLI:结账成功率与 P99 延迟&#10;sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=&quot;checkout&quot;,code!~&quot;5..&quot;}[5m]))&#10;  / sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=&quot;checkout&quot;}[5m]))&#10;histogram_quantile(&#10;  0.99,&#10;  sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=&quot;checkout&quot;}[5m])) by (le)&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 候选稳态 SLI:结账成功率与 P99 延迟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"checkout\",code!~\"5..\"}[5m]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  / sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"checkout\"}[5m]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>histogram_quantile(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  0.99,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"checkout\"}[5m])) by (le)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这样既能容忍正常抖动,又能在真实退化时及时触发。对照组的引入是关键:它把&quot;指标变了&quot;和&quot;是被我们注入的故障搞变的&quot;区分开来——也许指标变化只是恰逢流量高峰,对照组会同样波动,从而避免误判。这种对照设计是混沌工程区别于压测的科学性所在,也直接影响实验的可信度,详见<a href=\"../experiments/experiment-blast-radius\">实验设计与爆炸半径</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"假设的书写-具体-可证伪-有预期\">假设的书写:具体、可证伪、有预期</h2><p>一个合格的假设必须具体到能被一次实验明确地证实或推翻。对比两种写法:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>模糊:&quot;我们的系统对数据库故障有韧性。&quot;</p>\n<p>合格:&quot;当主数据库被注入 200ms 额外延迟、持续 5 分钟时,我们假设结账成功率维持在 99.5% 以上,P99 延迟上升不超过 100ms,且无人工干预下系统自动恢复。&quot;</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>合格版本指明了:注入什么故障(200ms 延迟)、作用对象(主数据库)、稳态指标(结账成功率、P99)、预期边界(99.5%、+100ms)、以及恢复预期(自动、无人工)。这五要素让实验结果不可争辩——要么落在边界内(假设成立),要么没有(抓到脆弱点)。书写假设时还要预先想好&quot;如果假设被推翻会怎样&quot;:这正是设定中止条件(abort condition)与控制爆炸半径的前提。值得强调的是,被推翻的假设比成立的假设更有价值,因为它指向了一个真实存在、此前未知的风险,后续如何把这类发现纳入修复闭环,见<a href=\"../culture/incident-learning\">事故与学习</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>稳态是一组代表业务正常运转的可测量指标,健康系统时刻波动但维持在可预期范围内。</li>\n<li>混沌实验是围绕稳态的波普尔式证伪:努力推翻&quot;系统健壮&quot;的假设,而非证明它。</li>\n<li>SLI 应选贴近用户的业务指标(如成功下单数、SPS),而非 CPU 等资源指标。</li>\n<li>稳态判定可从硬阈值升级为统计判定,用标准分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z = (x-\\mu)/\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 配合对照组区分真实退化与正常抖动。</li>\n<li>合格假设需具体到五要素:注入什么、作用对象、稳态指标、预期边界、恢复预期;被推翻的假设最有价值。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"稳态与假设","id":"稳态与假设"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"选择正确的 SLI:从系统指标到用户指标","id":"选择正确的-sli-从系统指标到用户指标"},{"level":2,"text":"量化稳态:从阈值到统计判定","id":"量化稳态-从阈值到统计判定"},{"level":2,"text":"假设的书写:具体、可证伪、有预期","id":"假设的书写-具体-可证伪-有预期"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"故障模式与影响","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/chaos-engineering/foundations/failure-modes"},"next":{"title":"实验设计与爆炸半径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/chaos-engineering/experiments/experiment-blast-radius"}}